          "_name": "timeline02",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"timeline02\" group=\"News\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" value=\"5\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Event\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Date\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#cccccc\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>PRACTICE AREAS</b></h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">At Lex &amp; Partners, our expertise spans across multiple legal disciplines:</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image active\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          2018\n        </p>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>1. Corporate &amp; Commercial Law</b></h5>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">We assist companies in drafting, reviewing, and negotiating commercial agreements, mergers,acquisitions, and compliance issues.\n<br>\n<br>Our goal is to protect your business interests while ensuring long-term growth.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper \">\n        <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-5\">\n          <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/corporate-commercial-law.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          2010\n        </p>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>2. Civil &amp; Criminal Litigation</b></h5>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Our litigation team represents clients in civil disputes, contract breaches, personal injury claims, and criminal defense.\n<br>\n<br>We focus on strong case strategy, thorough research, and persuasive argumentation.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper \">\n        <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-5\">\n          <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/civil-criminal-litigation.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div><div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          2010\n        </p>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>3. Real Estate &amp; Property Law</b></h5>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          From property transactions to tenancy disputes, our firm provides reliable legal support to buyers,sellers, and developers.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper \">\n        <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-5\">\n          <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/real-estate-property-law.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div><div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          2010\n        </p>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>4. Family &amp; Divorce Law</b></h5>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          We handle sensitive family matters with care, confidentiality, and respect — including divorce, child custody, and asset division.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper \">\n        <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-5\">\n          <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/family-divorce-law.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"4\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div><div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          2010\n        </p>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>5. Employment Law</b></h5>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          We guide both employers and employees through workplace disputes, unfair dismissals, and contractual issues.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper \">\n        <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-5\">\n          <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/employment-law.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"4\" data-bs-slide-to=\"4\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div><div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          2010\n        </p>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>6. Intellectual Property (IP) Law</b></h5>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          Our IP team protects your creative assets — trademarks, copyrights, and patents — from infringement and misuse.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper \">\n        <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-5\">\n          <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/intellectual-property-ip-law.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"5\" data-bs-slide-to=\"6\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uZL6zAJCfD",
          "_anchor": "timeline02-z",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)",
              "& when (@overlay)": {
                ".mbr-overlay": {
                  "background": "@overlayColor",
                  "opacity": "@overlayOpacity"
                }
              }
            },
            ".item-subtitle": {
              "line-height": "1.2",
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "img, .item-img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "& when (@autoSize)": {
                "height": "100%",
                "object-fit": "cover",
                "& when (@showCardTitle)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showCardSubtitle)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showText)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showButtons)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                }
              }
            },
            ".item:focus, span:focus": {
              "outline": "none"
            },
            ".item": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "& when not (@spacing)": {
              ".row": {
                "margin-left": "0",
                "margin-right": "0"
              },
              ".item": {
                "padding": "0",
                "margin": "0"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "border-radius": "4px",
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-flow": "column nowrap"
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn": {
              "margin-top": "auto !important"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#232323"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".item-title": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            }
          },
          "_name": "people03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"people03\" group=\"People\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\" selected>4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n\t\t<header>Cards</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize && !(showButtons==false && showCardSubtitle==false && showCardTitle==false && showText==false)\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Name\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Position\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#cccccc\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>OUR LAWYERS</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTo add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/adrian-layer-5.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Mr. Adrian Lim</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>Managing Partner</b></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Adrian has over 20 years of legal experience in corporate and commercial law.\n<br><br>He believes in strategic thinking, ethical advocacy, and building long-term client relationships.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Contact</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/rachel-layer.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Ms. Rachel Tan</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>Senior Associate</b></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Rachel specializes in family and employment law. She is known for her empathy and clear communication, guiding clients through complex legal processes with confidence.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Contact</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/daniel-layer-2.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Mr. Daniel Wong</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>Litigation Lawyer</b></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDaniel is passionate about defending justice. His courtroom experience includes civil, criminal, and arbitration cases.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Contact</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-img mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/alicia-layer.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Ms. Alicia Lee</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>Real Estate Consultant</b></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Alicia advises clients on property transactions and contract drafting. Her attention to detail ensures that every deal is secure and transparent.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Contact</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uZGWEErCKc",
          "_anchor": "people03-h",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
